for drinks.

53
00:02:18,639 --> 00:02:22,350
Or go downtown and
listen to some jazz.

54
00:02:22,392 --> 00:02:25,395
Or dancing.
Oh, take her dancing.

55
00:02:25,437 --> 00:02:27,064
You sure are naming
a lot of ways

56
