73
00:03:02,975 --> 00:03:05,226
Okay, okay, I'll go
with you, I'll go.
I'll go with you.

74
00:03:05,268 --> 00:03:07,562
It'd be fun.
All right?

75
00:03:07,604 --> 00:03:09,648
No, no. Yes!

76
00:03:09,690 --> 00:03:10,774
Ah.

77
00:03:10,816 --> 00:03:12,442
Oh, would you look
at that, Monica.

78
00:03:12,484 --> 00:03:15,194
