to feel faint, so...

116
00:04:47,829 --> 00:04:51,541
Oh, man.
This is so great.

117
00:04:51,583 --> 00:04:54,086
I actually feel like
I'm going on a real date.

118
00:04:54,128 --> 00:04:56,213
Although I have a hint
