200
00:08:15,536 --> 00:08:16,913
Oh, my God.

201
00:08:18,790 --> 00:08:21,542
That was fantastic.
I almost leaned in.

202
00:08:21,584 --> 00:08:23,211
I really almost did.

203
00:08:23,253 --> 00:08:25,588
All right, so tell me
one of your moves.

204
00:08:25,630 --> 00:08:27,382
All right...
( clears throat )

205
00:08:30,469 --> 00:08:31,928
So where'd you grow up?

206
00:08:33,680 --> 00:08:36,016
