218
00:08:58,955 --> 00:09:00,999
It is, yeah,
it's really tough.

219
00:09:01,041 --> 00:09:03,126
You know sometimes
I think...

220
00:09:03,168 --> 00:09:04,461
Wow.

221
00:09:06,796 --> 00:09:08,840
Nice move.

222
00:09:08,882 --> 00:09:10,758
